{"id": "EUVD-2026-74183", "enisaUuid": "7a4c633f-e7a4-3820-8141-b81bbf366417", "description": "The Okta Hyperdrive Agent writes the decoded SAML bearer assertion to a local application log file at the default log level on every successful MFA completion. This insertion of sensitive information into the log file makes a live authentication credential readable by any local user with access to the log file.", "datePublished": "2026-09-08T20:15:49", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-10T14:41:26", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:L/A:N", "references": ["https://trust.okta.com/security-advisories/improper-restriction-of-sensitive-information-in-okta-hyperdrive-agent-logging-cve-2026-78631"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7x42-7j3m-qc6m", "CVE-2026-78631"], "assigner": "Okta", "epss": 0.14, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a0523da6-f8f6-3fd4-ba40-8b4c0a94b0e1", "product": {"name": "Okta Hyperdrive Agent", "vendor": {"name": "Okta"}}, "product_version": "1.4.0 <1.5.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "aaa054fc-c326-3ba1-86df-5689f4396bff", "vendor": {"name": "Okta"}}], "isExploited": false}